==========================================================================================
wire: Wire (symbolic wire type, equivalent to DEF NETS wiring). Represents a wire segment.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
area: area, Area of the wire as defined by the LEF MACRO SIZE or OVERLAP information
beginExt(settable): coord, Extension of wire at the first point
box: rect, Bounding box of the shape
box_area: area, Area of bounding box of the shape
box_ll: pt, Lower left (ll) of bounding box of the shape
box_llx: coord, Lower left X (llx) of bounding box of the shape
box_lly: coord, Lower left Y (lly) of bounding box of the shape
box_size: pt, Size of bounding box of the shape
box_sizex: coord, Size X of bounding box of the shape
box_sizey: coord, Size Y of bounding box of the shape
box_ur: pt, Upper right (ur) of bounding box of the shape
box_urx: coord, Upper Right X (urx) of bounding box of the shape
box_ury: coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of bounding box of the shape
direction: enum(Horizontal Other Vertical), Direction of wire, consistent with layer direction from LEF/OpenAccess
endExt(settable): coord, Extension of wire at the second point
layer: obj(layer), Pointer to layer of wire
length: coord, Centerline length of wire between the endpoints (not the box width/height)
mask(settable): int, Indicates mask number for multiple mask layer usage. Refer to layer's .numMask attribute for legal range, 0 indicates uncolored.
net: obj(net), Pointer to net that the wire belongs to
objType: enum(antennaData antennaModel bndry bump bumpGrid bumpTerm bus busGuide busSinkGroup cellDensity densityShape fPlan foreign gCellGridDef group guiLine guiPoly guiRect guiText hInst hInstTerm hNet hTerm head inst instTerm io layer layerRule layerShape libCell marker net netGroup pBlkg pWire pd pgInstTerm pin pinGroup pinGuide pinShape pkgComponent pkgObject prop ptn ptnCell ptnPinBlkg rBlkg resistor resizeBlkg routeType row rule sViaInst sWire sdp shape shapeVia site stackViaRule term text topCell trackDef vCell vWire via viaInst viaRuleGenerate whatIfVia whatIfWire wire), Object type: Wire
pts: list(pt), 2 points (center-line) for the wire
rule: obj(rule), Pointer to non-default rule corresponding to the wire, wires with the default routing rule will return NULL (0x0).
status(settable): enum(cover fixed noshield routed unknown), Wiring status (equivalent to DEF NETS regular wiring status)
width: coord, Width of wire
